## Check

```bash
uv run ruff check .
uv run ruff format --check .
uv run mypy {{ package_name }} tests
uv run pytest
```

## Layout

- `{{ package_name }}/pipeline.py`: extract, validate, transform (one Polars expression chain), and load as typed functions.
- `{{ package_name }}/cli.py`: the Typer command; a thin layer over `pipeline`.
- `tests/`: pytest; the pipeline runs on the sample, and each validation failure is tested.

